# Trading Context

## Who is the trader

- Day-trades SPX 0DTE options (calls and puts) on E*TRADE
- Account under $25K (PDT restriction lifts June 1, 2026)
- Trading since Jan 2026, 319+ trades logged
- Scalper style: best edge is sub-5-minute trades (81.4% win rate, +$8,292)

## Core stats (as of May 14, 2026)

- Actual P/L: -$5,400 across 319 trades
- Simulated (sub-5-min + -50% stop cap): +$8,457 — a $13,857 discipline gap
- Win rate: 61.8% overall, 82.6% on sub-2-min holds
