## The playbook (`TRADING_PLAYBOOK.md`)

Read this file for the full system. Key rules:
- OT-OCO on every trade (entry triggers +30% target / -50% stop)
- Max 1 contract on SPX until 2 consecutive green weeks
- 1-3 min time stop, 5 min absolute max hold
- Never cancel OCO to go manual — use Modify
- Qty check: entry = profit leg = stop leg
- Avoid 10:00-11:30 AM window
- Re-entry Runner for bigger moves (Section 5 of playbook)
- June 1+: 5 trades/day cap, -$300 daily loss limit

